        array("id" => "s6e5", "season" => 6, "number" => 5, "name" => "Architect of Destruction", "airdate" => "18 Oct 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "Ted becomes conflicted about pursuing his dream job of designing the new GNB headquarters after meeting a hot girl who's passionate about saving the landmark building that is being torn down to make room for it.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/246572.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e6", "season" => 6, "number" => 6, "name" => "Baby Talk", "airdate" => "25 Oct 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "Marshall and Lily research how to conceive a baby with the gender of their choice. Meanwhile, Robin is growing more and more irritated by her perky new co-anchor, Becky.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/246579.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e7", "season" => 6, "number" => 7, "name" => "Canning Randy", "airdate" => "1 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "When Zoey enrolls in Ted's class, she manipulates his students into taking her side in the fight to save the building being torn down to make room for his project. Meanwhile, Marshall and Lily spot Robin marching in the Halloween parade of shame.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/246580.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e8", "season" => 6, "number" => 8, "name" => "Natural History", "airdate" => "8 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "When the gang attends a black tie fundraiser at the Natural History Museum, Ted runs into Zoey and sees a whole different side of her when she introduces him to her husband, The Captain.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/246587.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e9", "season" => 6, "number" => 9, "name" => "Glitter", "airdate" => "15 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "When Barney finds a copy of the Canadian kids show \"Space Teens\" starring Robin's alter-ego \"Robin Sparkles,\" the gang learns more about Robin's past as a performer than they expected.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/246601.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e10", "season" => 6, "number" => 10, "name" => "Blitzgiving", "airdate" => "22 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "When Ted leaves the bar early to prepare a Thanksgiving feast for his friends, the gang winds up partying all night with The Blitz, an old friend from college who has bad luck. As a result Ted is forced to spend Thanksgiving with Zoey.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/246798.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e11", "season" => 6, "number" => 11, "name" => "The Mermaid Theory", "airdate" => "6 Dec 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "When Ted's new friendship with Zoey tests the theory that men and married women can't be friends, he invites her husband, \"The Captain,\" to hang out with them. Meanwhile, Marshall and Robin decide to spend alone time together.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/246802.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e12", "season" => 6, "number" => 12, "name" => "False Positive", "airdate" => "13 Dec 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "When Marshall and Lily receive shocking news, it has a profound effect on the gang and forces them to reexamine their own lives. Meanwhile, Robin gets a new job, Barney discovers the joy of giving on Christmas and Ted begins his duties as Best Man for his old…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/246806.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e13", "season" => 6, "number" => 13, "name" => "Bad News", "airdate" => "3 Jan 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.1, "summary" => "When Marshall and Lily fear they will never get pregnant, they see a specialist who can hopefully help move the process along. Meanwhile, Robin starts her new job.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/246811.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e14", "season" => 6, "number" => 14, "name" => "Last Words", "airdate" => "17 Jan 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "The gang travels home to Minnesota with Marshall where Ted and Barney will stop at nothing to make Marshall laugh. Meanwhile, Marshall has an unfortunate meeting with an old high school bully that terrorized him throughout his youth.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/246812.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e15", "season" => 6, "number" => 15, "name" => "Oh Honey", "airdate" => "7 Feb 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "When Zoey fixes Ted up on a date with her cousin, the gang resorts to calling her \"Honey\" after learning how naive she is. Meanwhile, Ted calls an intervention on himself after having an epiphany about his feelings for Zoey, and Barney gets acquainted with Ho…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/246813.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e16", "season" => 6, "number" => 16, "name" => "Desperation Day", "airdate" => "14 Feb 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "Barney declares February 13th \"Desperation Day,\" a holiday for desperate women. Meanwhile, Lily surprises Marshall for Valentine's Day, Ted and Zoey continue to figure out their relationship and Robin bonds with her single girlfriends.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/246815.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e17", "season" => 6, "number" => 17, "name" => "Garbage Island", "airdate" => "21 Feb 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "After Marshall sees a documentary about garbage, he becomes fixated on saving the environment. Meanwhile, Ted runs into Zoey's ex-husband, The Captain, and Robin forces Barney to admit he has feelings for Nora, the girl who made history as his first Valentine…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/247082.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e18", "season" => 6, "number" => 18, "name" => "A Change of Heart", "airdate" => "28 Feb 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "When Barney starts to have real feelings for Nora, he worries that there is something wrong with his heart. Meanwhile, Robyn starts dating a guy who acts a lot like a dog.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/247083.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e19", "season" => 6, "number" => 19, "name" => "Legendaddy", "airdate" => "21 Mar 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "When Barney finally meets his father, he's surprised to learn how his life turned out. Meanwhile, the gang points out each other's \"gaps,\" something they should know by adulthood but never learned.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/247085.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e20", "season" => 6, "number" => 20, "name" => "The Exploding Meatball Sub", "airdate" => "11 Apr 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.1, "summary" => "Lily and Barney react badly when Marshall finally quits his job at Goliath National Bank to take a volunteer position at an environmental organization. Meanwhile, Ted and Zoey's opposing positions on the future of the Arcadia come between them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/247092.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e21", "season" => 6, "number" => 21, "name" => "Hopeless", "airdate" => "18 Apr 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "When Barney tries to bond with his father, he asks the gang to help make his life seem more exciting by lying about their own lives. Meanwhile, Robin runs into a guy she has a crush on.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/247475.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e22", "season" => 6, "number" => 22, "name" => "The Perfect Cocktail", "airdate" => "2 May 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "When Marshall and Barney argue over the destruction of the Arcadian Hotel, Robin and Lily try to mix the right combination of cocktails that will force them to make up. Meanwhile, Ted plans a romantic weekend away with Zoey.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/247480.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e23", "season" => 6, "number" => 23, "name" => "Landmarks", "airdate" => "9 May 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "When Ted is faced with an important decision that might affect his future with Zoey, the gang expresses their true feelings about her.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/247482.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e24", "season" => 6, "number" => 24, "name" => "Challenge Accepted", "airdate" => "16 May 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Robin and Barney bond when they intervene in Ted's relationship, and Marshall and Lily watch a ticking clock as he fears that he soon will be the victim of food poisoning. Meanwhile, Ted performs his Best Man duties at a very important wedding", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/98/247487.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 7, "name" => "Season 7", "rating" => 7.5, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s7e1", "season" => 7, "number" => 1, "name" => "The Best Man", "airdate" => "19 Sep 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "While Barney prepares for his wedding to a mystery bride, he and Ted reminisce about Punchy's wedding, including when Marshall and Lily announced they are having a baby. Meanwhile, Robin considers telling Barney she has feelings for him.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/247979.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e2", "season" => 7, "number" => 2, "name" => "The Naked Truth", "airdate" => "19 Sep 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "When Marshall gets the job of his dreams, he worries that, once the company discovers videos he made in the past, they may rescind the offer. Meanwhile, Ted can't decide who to bring to the Architects Ball.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/247995.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e3", "season" => 7, "number" => 3, "name" => "Ducky Tie", "airdate" => "26 Sep 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.1, "summary" => "After Ted runs into an old girlfriend, he tries to make amends with her since he cheated during their relationship. Meanwhile, Marshall and Lily make a bet with Barney that could force him to wear Marshall's ducky tie.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/248332.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e4", "season" => 7, "number" => 4, "name" => "The Stinson Missile Crisis", "airdate" => "3 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "After Robin assaults a girl who is out to ruin Barney's relationship, she is forced to begin court-mandated therapy sessions. Meanwhile, Ted gets too involved in Lily's pregnancy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/248335.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e5", "season" => 7, "number" => 5, "name" => "Field Trip", "airdate" => "10 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 6.9, "summary" => "When Marshall witnesses his boss's soft approach in settling with a million dollar company, he takes matters into his own hands. Meanwhile, Ted takes his architecture class on a field trip and things don't go as planned.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/248378.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e6", "season" => 7, "number" => 6, "name" => "Mystery vs. History", "airdate" => "17 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.2, "summary" => "When Ted goes on a date without researching the girl on the Internet, the gang interferes, showing Kevin that they are too into each other's business. Meanwhile, Lily and Marshall come to terms with finding out the sex of their baby.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/248642.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e7", "season" => 7, "number" => 7, "name" => "Noretta", "airdate" => "24 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7, "summary" => "The gang begins to realize their romantic partner reminds them of one of their parents. Meanwhile, Barney and Nora's planned romantic evening is ruined by a string of bad events.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/248723.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e8", "season" => 7, "number" => 8, "name" => "The Slutty Pumpkin Returns", "airdate" => "31 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 6.8, "summary" => "Ted finally meets his mystery girl in the Slutty Pumpkin costume. Meanwhile, Barney learns he is part Canadian, and Lily has pregnancy brain.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/248724.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e9", "season" => 7, "number" => 9, "name" => "Disaster Averted", "airdate" => "7 Nov 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "The gang reminisces about what happened during Hurricane Irene and Barney tries desperately to get out of wearing the ducky tie.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/248857.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e10", "season" => 7, "number" => 10, "name" => "Tick Tick Tick...", "airdate" => "14 Nov 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "Barney and Robin find themselves in an uncomfortable situation when they hide a secret from their significant others. Meanwhile, Marshall, Lily and Ted attend a concert.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/248863.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e11", "season" => 7, "number" => 11, "name" => "The Rebound Girl", "airdate" => "21 Nov 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Ted and Barney discuss making a life-changing decision together, and Robin tries to discourage Marshall and Lily from moving to Long Island.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/248995.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e12", "season" => 7, "number" => 12, "name" => "Symphony of Illumination", "airdate" => "5 Dec 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "When Robin receives bad news, she decides to lie about it to the gang. Meanwhile, Marshall hangs Christmas decorations on the house in the 'burbs with help from his neighbor.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/248998.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e13", "season" => 7, "number" => 13, "name" => "Tailgate", "airdate" => "2 Jan 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 6.9, "summary" => "After celebrating New Year's Eve, Marshall visits his father's graveside to carry on their tradition of tailgating. Meanwhile, Barney and Ted open a bar called \"Puzzles,\" and Robin is forced to fill in for an inebriated news anchor.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/249015.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e14", "season" => 7, "number" => 14, "name" => "46 Minutes", "airdate" => "16 Jan 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.1, "summary" => "Lily and Marshall officially move to the suburbs and realize that Lily's bossy father refuses to move out of their house. Meanwhile, the gang adjusts to them moving by going to a strip club.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/249267.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e15", "season" => 7, "number" => 15, "name" => "The Burning Beekeeper", "airdate" => "6 Feb 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 6.9, "summary" => "Lily and Marshall throw a housewarming party, where Ted nearly comes to blows with Marshall's boss, and Barney hits on a crazy divorcee.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/249268.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e16", "season" => 7, "number" => 16, "name" => "The Drunk Train", "airdate" => "13 Feb 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.3, "summary" => "For Valentine's Day, Lily and Marshall invite Robin and Kevin on a weekend getaway to Vermont, where Kevin and Robin discussing taking their relationship to the next level. Meanwhile, Barney realizes he has finally met his match.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/249591.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e17", "season" => 7, "number" => 17, "name" => "No Pressure", "airdate" => "20 Feb 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "When Robin breaks up with Kevin, Ted confesses his feelings to her. Meanwhile, Barney is on a mission to find something private of Marshall and Lily's.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/249599.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e18", "season" => 7, "number" => 18, "name" => "Karma", "airdate" => "27 Feb 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Barney tries to pursue Quinn, even after learning she is a stripper. Meanwhile, Marshall and Lily introduce Robin to life in the suburbs and Ted tries to figure out what to do with Robin's old room.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/249639.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e19", "season" => 7, "number" => 19, "name" => "The Broath", "airdate" => "19 Mar 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "The gang tries to break up Barney and Quinn after learning they plan on moving in together, leaving Robin and Ted to fight over who deserves to sublet her apartment.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/249915.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e20", "season" => 7, "number" => 20, "name" => "Trilogy Time", "airdate" => "9 Apr 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "Ted, Marshall and Barney embark on another \"trilogy time,\" where they get together every three years to watch the \"Star Wars\" trilogy and envision what their lives will be like in another three years. Meanwhile Barney and Quinn move in together.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/99/249918.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e21", "season" => 7, "number" => 21, "name" => "Now We're Even", "airdate" => "16 Apr 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Just as Ted starts to settle into his new apartment alone, Barney tries to entice him into going out every single night. Meanwhile, Lily has a naughty dream about someone other then Marshall, and Robin finally becomes a famous news anchor.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/250182.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e22", "season" => 7, "number" => 22, "name" => "Good Crazy", "airdate" => "30 Apr 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "When Lily and Marshall have a baby shower, Marshall starts to panic after realizing the baby is coming soon. Meanwhile, Ted and Robin come to terms with their relationship and Barney takes Marshall on a road trip.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/250183.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e23", "season" => 7, "number" => 23, "name" => "The Magician's Code (1)", "airdate" => "14 May 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "While Marshall is in Atlantic City with Barney, Lily goes into labor, leaving him desperate to make it back to New York before the baby is born. Meanwhile, Ted and Robin try to distract Lily during her painful contractions.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/250210.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e24", "season" => 7, "number" => 24, "name" => "The Magician's Code (2)", "airdate" => "14 May 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "On Barney's future wedding day, when his wife is finally revealed, the gang reminisces about the time they encouraged Ted to follow his heart and go after the one that got away.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/250214.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 8, "name" => "Season 8", "rating" => 7.3, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s8e1", "season" => 8, "number" => 1, "name" => "Farhampton", "airdate" => "24 Sep 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "Robin's anxiety on her wedding day to Barney prompts Ted to recount the time he insisted on leaving Victoria's jilted fiancé a note before they drove off into the sunset together.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/250465.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e2", "season" => 8, "number" => 2, "name" => "The Pre-Nup", "airdate" => "1 Oct 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 6.9, "summary" => "When Barney designs an extensive pre-nup, the guys take note and propose their own relationship amendments to their significant others. Meanwhile, Quinn is outraged and draws up a pre-nup of her own, which causes friction between the sexes.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/250469.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e3", "season" => 8, "number" => 3, "name" => "Nannies", "airdate" => "8 Oct 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 6.7, "summary" => "When Lily and Marshall have trouble finding a nanny, they learn it's because of an elaborate scheme Barney came up with to meet girls. Meanwhile, Robin and Ted butt heads over who has a more serious relationship.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/250481.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e4", "season" => 8, "number" => 4, "name" => "Who Wants to Be a Godparent?", "airdate" => "15 Oct 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.1, "summary" => "When Lily and Marshall can't decide on godparents for Marvin, they put the gang to the test to see who would make the best one.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/250696.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e5", "season" => 8, "number" => 5, "name" => "The Autumn of Break-Ups", "airdate" => "5 Nov 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 6.9, "summary" => "As the season of break-ups continues, Ted and Victoria must choose the next step in their long and complicated relationship. Meanwhile, Robin worries about Barney when he chooses a dog to be his wingman.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/250723.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e6", "season" => 8, "number" => 6, "name" => "Splitsville", "airdate" => "12 Nov 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.3, "summary" => "When Robin is hesitant to break up with Nick, Barney takes matters into his own hands. Meanwhile, Lily and Marshall are desperate for some private time.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/250728.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e7", "season" => 8, "number" => 7, "name" => "The Stamp Tramp", "airdate" => "19 Nov 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 6.7, "summary" => "Marshall recommends his old law school classmate Brad for a job at his firm, but the interview goes awry, leaving Marshall to do damage control with his boss. Meanwhile, Robin helps negotiate Barney's return to the strip club circuit.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/250823.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e8", "season" => 8, "number" => 8, "name" => "Twelve Horny Women", "airdate" => "26 Nov 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.1, "summary" => "Marshall takes on his old friend/new nemesis Brad in the biggest case of his career. Meanwhile, the gang reminisces about their own run-ins with the law, leading to a debate over who was the biggest delinquent as a teenager.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/250927.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e9", "season" => 8, "number" => 9, "name" => "Lobster Crawl", "airdate" => "3 Dec 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.1, "summary" => "Robin is determined to get Barney back no matter what it takes. Meanwhile, Ted fills in as Marvin's Nanny, leading Marshall and Lily to realize that Ted is using baby Marvin to replace his other baby - the GNB building.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/251030.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e10", "season" => 8, "number" => 10, "name" => "The Over-Correction", "airdate" => "10 Dec 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Robin becomes increasingly suspicious of Barney's relationship with Patrice. Meanwhile, Marshall discovers his mother is moving on in her romantic life... with a very disturbing partner.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/251039.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e11", "season" => 8, "number" => 11, "name" => "The Final Page (1)", "airdate" => "17 Dec 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "With Christmas fast approaching, Barney tells Ted that he plans on proposing to Patrice, which leads Ted to debate whether or not to tell Robin.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/251130.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e12", "season" => 8, "number" => 12, "name" => "The Final Page (2)", "airdate" => "17 Dec 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Marshall and Lily run into an acquaintance from college", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/251132.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e13", "season" => 8, "number" => 13, "name" => "Band or DJ?", "airdate" => "14 Jan 2013", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "When Robin learns that Barney never asked her father's permission before proposing, she insists that he seek his approval before announcing their engagement. Meanwhile, Ted keeps his feelings concealed by throwing himself into planning their wedding.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/251135.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s8e14", "season" => 8, "number" => 14, "name" => "Ring Up!", "airdate" => "21 Jan 2013", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.3, "summary" => "Barney begs Ted to continue seeing his much younger, much wilder girlfriend, even though Ted has nothing in common with her. Meanwhile, Robin must adjust to the power of the bling.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/100/251139.jpg"),
